        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Vaughn, Bert Kaempfert\n- Works: “A Swingin' Safari”\n- Topics: chart performance, biography\n\nFacts:\n- Bert Kaempfert, born Berthold Heinrich Kämpfert, was born on 16 October 1923 and died on 21 June 1980.\n- Bert Kaempfert was a German orchestra leader, music producer, and songwriter.\n- In the same year referenced for “A Swingin' Safari,” Billy Vaughn recorded the work.\n- Billy Vaughn’s cover of “A Swingin' Safari” reached number 13 on the Billboard charts that summer.",
